# Generated by `tree-sitter generate` from grammar.js. `check.sh` regenerates
# before it parses anything, so the checked-in tree stays the two files a person
# actually edits: grammar.js and src/scanner.c.
#
# When the grammar is published as its own repository — which is what
# `extension.toml` fetches — that repository does commit these, because Zed
# builds the grammar without the tree-sitter CLI.
src/parser.c
src/grammar.json
src/node-types.json
src/tree_sitter/
grammar.json
node-types.json
